icle\"><div data-builder-component=\"article\" data-builder-content-id=\"bd3b8422074b4927a7c41633f37748bb\" data-builder-variation-id=\"bd3b8422074b4927a7c41633f37748bb\"><style data-emotion-css=\"h47494\"></style><div class=\"builder-blocks css-h47494\" builder-type=\"blocks\"><div class=\"builder-block builder-d174570345fc463e890cc5449c27ccbe builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-d174570345fc463e890cc5449c27ccbe\"><style data-emotion-css=\"1qggkls\"></style><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><h2>Who We Are</h2></span></div><p class=\"builder-block builder-02e8c215bd46434d9b28fa6d0528a8a6 builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-02e8c215bd46434d9b28fa6d0528a8a6\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><p>Grove Marketing Co. is a digital marketing agency serving the Space Coast of Florida and surrounding areas. We work with clients across several industries to help them build their brand identity, increase their digital presence, and most importantly, drive sales.</p></span></p><p class=\"builder-block builder-bd51db4419a54cf8828dba96f962173d builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-bd51db4419a54cf8828dba96f962173d\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><p>Based in Brevard County, we proudly serve the Central Florida community to help both small-to-medium-sized local businesses and larger corporations usher their brands into the modern digital economy.</p></span></p><style data-emotion-css=\"1i2qq4x\"></style><a role=\"button\" href=\"#contactForm\" class=\"builder-block builder-bf77532f20ed43e893e3cb6ff9cd93b5 builder-has-component css-1i2qq4x\" builder-id=\"builder-bf77532f20ed43e893e3cb6ff9cd93b5\">Interested in learning more? Let&#x27;s Get In Touch</a><div class=\"builder-block builder-fc46e1dd8f0e431ca2b74f7dd252cb5d builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-fc46e1dd8f0e431ca2b74f7dd252cb5d\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><h2>Primary Areas We Serve</h2></span></div><p class=\"builder-block builder-edba848435584a80955ac0852ac59a0b builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-edba848435584a80955ac0852ac59a0b\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><p>Melbourne, Palm Bay, Cocoa, Cocoa Beach, Titusville, Merritt Island, Satellite Beach, Rockledge, Viera, Cape Canaveral.</p></span></p><div class=\"builder-block builder-042c5e6c9efa496e8f0660f55c9e397f builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-042c5e6c9efa496e8f0660f55c9e397f\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><h2>Our Services</h2></span></div><p class=\"builder-block builder-4efda9a78b23453b9816aa3e42c93b37 builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-4efda9a78b23453b9816aa3e42c93b37\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><p>Using our team's years of experience, we cover the full scope of your digital advertising needs, including but not limited to:</p></span></p><div class=\"builder-block builder-803dacfecf9c4f5a89fffd0835cd3f02 builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-803dacfecf9c4f5a89fffd0835cd3f02\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><ul><li><a href=\"/services/web-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Full-Stack Web Design &amp; Development</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/advertising-seo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEO</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/advertising-seo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Ads/Meta Ads/PPC with Analytics</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/content-creation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Content Creation (photo/video)</a></li><li>Email Marketing</li><li><a href=\"/services/integration-automation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Integration &amp; Automation</a></li></ul></span></div><p class=\"builder-block builder-c9fbc2e4ee344d179d76cf7f96d0ade6 builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-c9fbc2e4ee344d179d76cf7f96d0ade6\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><p>We offer both full service and a la carte options fitted to meet your business' personal needs.</p></span></p><div class=\"builder-block builder-455a6977bb7f47e4b9d0186cf1c7583f builder-has-component css-0\" builder-id=\"builder-455a6977bb7f47e4b9d0186cf1c7583f\"><span class=\"builder-text css-1qggkls\"><h2>Trusted Locally and Nationwide</h2></span></div><style data-emotion-css=\"1ew37k\"></style><div class=\"builder-block builder-01a47c1caaee49bc80176fee5897c387 box css-1ew37k\" builder-id=\"builder-01a47c1caaee49bc80176fee5897c387\"><style data-emotion-css=\"aomd23\"></style><div class=\"builder-block builder-a9c95401703c4b6b9df4d5cf661c609d builder-has-component css-aomd23\" builder-id=\"builder-a9c95401703c4b6b9df4d5cf661c609d\"><style data-emotion-css=\"1840m1q\"></style><div class=\"builder-columns css-1840m1q\"><style data-emotion-css=\"9gwn1l\"></style><div class=\"builder-column css-9gwn1l\"><div class=\"builder-blocks builder-blocks-child css-h47494\" builder-type=\"blocks\" builder-parent-id=\"builder-a9c95401703c4b6b9df4d5cf661c609d\"><style data-emotion-css=\"1lp5ngh\"></style><div class=\"builder-block builder-832c5c33606a4840bb5a2d9ba74b2dc6 css-1lp5ngh\" builder-id=\"builder-832c5c33606a4840bb5a2d9ba74b2dc6\"><picture><style data-emotion-css=\"12153wi\"></style><img alt=\"Kennedy Space Center logo\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"builder-image css-12153wi\" src=\"https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F04a66a34a825475f879a3a1be1673b31%2F0437e7211e244339922310ce3e3ea120\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F04a66a34a825475f879a3a1be1673b31%2F0437e7211e244339922310ce3e3ea120?width=100 100w, https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F04a66a34a825475f879a3a1be1673b31%2F0437e7211e244339922310ce3e3ea120?width=200 200w, https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F04a66a34a825475f879a3a1be1673b31%2F0437e7211e244339922310ce3e3ea120?width=400 400w, https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F04a66a34a825475f879a3a1be1673b31%2F0437e7211e244339922310ce3e3ea120?width=800 800w, https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/image/assets%2F04a66a34a825475f879a3a1be1673b31%2F0437e7211e244339922310ce3e3ea120?width=12